WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:09.030
Redline Racers is a racing card game about how much risk you can stand. Two to six players, and the computer can race too.

2
00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:18.049
Each turn, everyone secretly picks a gear, one to four, and plays that many cards. Your total is how many spaces you move.

3
00:00:18.199 --> 00:00:20.747
Jumping two gears costs a point of heat.

4
00:00:21.447 --> 00:00:30.357
The corners have a speed limit. Take one too fast and you pay a heat for every point over. If you can't pay, you spin out and stop at the corner.

5
00:00:30.508 --> 00:00:36.439
Heat goes into your discard pile as dead cards that clog your hand later, so it does catch up with you.

6
00:00:37.139 --> 00:00:47.454
Low gears let you cool the engine down. You can also boost, paying a heat for an extra card, and if you finish right behind a rival, you get a slipstream bonus.

7
00:00:47.604 --> 00:00:52.773
First to finish all the laps wins. Fast on the straights, careful through the corners.
